        "Say Allahu Akbar and go down into sajdah drawn together: the arms resting on the ground close to the sides, the belly on the thighs and both feet turned out to the right. Recite the tasbih at least three times." to "Dite Allahu Akbar e scendete in sajdah uniti: le braccia appoggiate a terra vicino ai fianchi, la pancia sulle cosce ed entrambi i piedi rivolti a destra. Recitare il tasbih almeno tre volte.",
